☕ Coffee Shop Sales Intelligence Dashboard

An interactive data analytics dashboard built to convert raw coffee shop sales data into actionable business insights. This project provides a comprehensive overview of transactions, quantity sold, revenue, and profit, helping stakeholders understand performance trends and make data-driven decisions.

🔍 Project Highlights

Category-wise sales and revenue analysis (beverages, snacks, desserts, sandwiches)

Weekday transaction trends to identify peak customer activity

Monthly and yearly revenue comparisons for performance tracking

City-wise revenue distribution for regional analysis

Clean, intuitive dashboard design focused on clarity and usability

🛠 Skills & Concepts Demonstrated

Data analysis & KPI tracking

Data visualization and dashboard design

Business intelligence & reporting

Insight-driven storytelling with data

This project showcases how analytics can be applied to real-world retail scenarios to improve visibility, performance evaluation, and strategic planning.
